    "attributes": {
        "action": "Allow 16 and 17-year-olds to access NHS gender-affirming hormone treatment",
        "additional_details": "We believe the lack of NHS access can cause unnecessary distress and that young people should be able to access HRT before turning 18.",
        "background": "People under 18 are currently unable to access gender-affirming HRT through the NHS. We believe this should be changed so young people can access HRT to help reduce gender dysphoria.",
